OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHeathrow and Gatwick among
OL,4,Aairports hit by air traffic control
OL,5,Aproblems
OL,6,
OL,7,FFlights from airports in the UK and
OL,8,FIreland are being heavily disrupted by
OL,9,Fa technical problem affecting the air
OL,10,Ftraffic control provider Nats.
OL,12,FAround 200 flights have been cancelled,
OL,13,Faccording to tracking website
OL,14,FFlightRadar24. British Airways and
OL,15,FRyanair have both confirmed
OL,16,Fcancellations.
OL,18,FHeathrow, Gatwick, Stansted, East
OL,19,FMidlands and Dublin are among those to
OL,20,Fwarn of potential delays.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
